+/*
+ * The version TZ reports for one of its features (a service id, e.g.
+ * QCOM_SCM_SVC_MP): major << 22 | minor << 12 | patch, as the CAF kernel's
+ * scm_get_feat_version() (OnePlus 2: CAF sets the content-protection pool
